; UC-01b CHT v2 — visible GUI, no /exit
; DP-A P=1100 W is the plate (two dies). GPU branch SPLIT_GPU=0.80 -> 880 W and 1.60 L/min.
; 128 holes per die, 256 holes on the plate. HBM 20% is not in this coupon.
; q'' = 880 / (256 * 3.0mm * 2.4mm) = 477430.55555555556 W/m2. mdot = rho*1.60L/min/256.
; Mesh: uc01b_cht_v2.msh  (4472280 HEXA, hardlink of the oriented fine mesh)
; fluid 2760804 / Cu 1533156 / TIM 178320
; Do not loosen 1e-4 / 1e-6. Window stays open.
;
; vs stalled fluid-only (continuity 0.18-0.30 @ 400/800, SIMPLE default):
;   coupled P-V, pseudo-transient, 1st-order startup then 2nd-order,
;   residual CRITERIA (not a fixed 80/400 stop), UR documented below.
; Targets (do not loosen): continuity/xyz-mom < 1e-4, energy < 1e-6
; k/omega 1e-3 so turbulence does not block the required flow/energy stop.
;
